vation robes with a high topknot and jade hairpin, wielding a slender glowing qingfeng flying sword.\n<Subject 2> is the talisman cultivator \"Chi Xiao\" (赤霄) referenced from <Picture 2>, a slender young woman in dark-red-and-black waisted robes with talisman-script embroidery, holding a short staff topped with a pulsing red rune orb.\n<Picture 1> is the four-view character reference for <Subject 1> (close-up head plus headless front/side/back), defining his robe, hairstyle, sword, and body proportions.\n<Picture 2> is the four-view character reference for <Subject 2> (close-up head plus headless front/side/back), defining her robe, talismans, staff, and body proportions.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a 10-second 3D donghua duel (斗法) between <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> on a broken stone platform above a sea of clouds. Both cultivators are referenced from <Picture 1> and <Picture 2>. The fight follows a spiral-collapse motion motif where sword qi and spell fire wind around a central axis and collapse into a final clash. HARD RULES: the two never fight in place — they maintain continuous large-scale spatial displacement (dashing, leaping, flipping, sliding, crossing kills, knockbacks); every clash erupts a ring shockwave with debris and a stagger; afterimages and motion streaks and a pressure energy field are present throughout; energy only bursts from close contact, never as pure effect bombardment.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in all shots): fully_preserved - blue-white robe, qingfeng sword, lean build, topknot retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in all shots): fully_preserved - dark-red-black robe, talisman embroidery, staff orb, silhouette retained.\n<Picture 1> (character reference): fully_preserved - appearance anchor for <Subject 1>.\n<Picture 2> (character reference): fully_preserved - appearance anchor for <Subject 2>.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a 3D Chinese donghua (xianxia) style with semi-realistic rendering, detailed fabric, and cinematic dusk lighting, set on a broken ancient stone platform above a sea of clouds with floating debris and drifting spirit-light particles. Throughout the fight: the two cultivators keep moving across large space and never stand still trading blows; each sword-qi hit, barrier block, or body collision bursts a ring shockwave with radiant debris and a visible stagger; afterimages, motion streaks and a dense pressure energy field surround both fighters; all energy erupts only from their weapons meeting, not from empty blasts.\n\n[Shot 1] A medium low-angle shot opens already in motion: <Subject 1>, the blue-robed sword cultivator, steps off a floating rock and dives forward riding his glowing qingfeng sword, the blade trailing a cyan-white motion streak; <Subject 2>, the red-robed talisman cultivator, instantly unfolds a glowing Lihuo talisman barrier humming with red runes. The sword qi meets the barrier in a burst of cyan ring shockwave and radiant debris that ripples the cloud sea; <Subject 1> uses the rebound to slide low along the ground toward the side-rear with afterimage steps, never stopping in place.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:01.600, a side tracking medium shot as <Subject 1> spins and releases three consecutive crescent sword-qi arcs with the Liuyun Huifeng sword style; each arc strikes the barrier and bursts a cyan ring shockwave with stone debris. <Subject 2> detonates a fire talisman that blooms into an expanding ring of flames, knocking them apart; <Subject 1> crosses horizontally through the broken-pillar shadow as a sliding kill, while <Subject 2> is knocked back and staggers half a step, the first clear reaction.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:03.400, a tight tracking shot stays in the fight: <Subject 2> claps hands and summons a Jiuxiao thunder-talisman array on the ground, lightning crawling and carving scorched furrows; <Subject 1> leaps and slides low in continuous variable lines as crossing kills, dodges the lightning, then flicks his sword to tear the talisman paper scroll and break the array. <Subject 2> is blown back and crashes into a broken stone pillar, which shatters and sprays fragments tumbling into the clouds; she is clearly off-balance — no empty wide beat, the action never pauses.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:05.400, an orbiting medium shot circles the close-range grapple: <Subject 1> drives Qingming sword-art pinpoint thrusts; <Subject 2> meets them with Huilei rebound palm blocks. Every meeting bursts a ring air-wave with radiant debris; <Subject 1> uses the momentum to loop and dive, blasting <Subject 2> horizontally back several feet with a stagger, her robe whipping, afterimages and streaks thick around both.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:07.400, a wide orbiting shot as their energies intertwine: <Subject 1>'s cyan sword-qi and <Subject 2>'s red talisman fire spiral around a central vertical axis, winding tighter and accelerating; the two orbit the axis with a large radius (not standing still), debris and spirit-light particles sucked into the spin, a strong pressure energy field around both, afterimages dense.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:09.000, the spiral collapses at the center in a single collision: a one-to-two-frame white flash fills the screen, then a shockwave expands outward, flipping a ring of stone slabs and blasting the cloud mist apart. The camera jerks with a single hard shake and settles on the ruined platform full shot as the flash fades. <|cutoff|>\n\noverall_soundscape:\nMetal-on-energy clash rings and a low hum of the talisman barrier; fire talisman detonation with a concussive whoosh; thunder array crackle and stone scorching; sword cleaving stone with a sharp shing and debris clatter; a final white-noise blast and collapsing rubble; constant wind across the sea of clouds and fabric whipping; dense afterimage whooshes on every rapid move.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA tense erhu-and-percussion battle score, accelerating tempo with rising low drums and plucked strings, peaking at the final collapse then cutting to silence."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [7.323581695556641, 5349.24462890625], "id": 93, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VIDEO", "links": [158], "label": "VIDEO", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "视频"}], "size": [270, 150], "pos": [1962.625732421875, 4593.07177734375], "widgets_values": [24, "auto", "sRGB", "none"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 156, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio", "link": 157, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "fps"}, "name": "fps", "label": "fps", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "帧率"}, {"widget": {"name": "bit_depth"}, "shape": 7, "name": "bit_depth", "label": "bit_depth", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "bit_depth"}, {"widget": {"name": "color_space"}, "shape": 7, "name": "color_space", "label": "color_space", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "color_space"}, {"widget": {"name": "codec"}, "shape": 7, "name": "codec", "label": "codec", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "codec"}], "flags": {}, "id": 76, "type": "CreateVideo", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CreateVideo"}, "order": 32}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "video_url", "label": "video_url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "video_url"}, {"name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}], "size": [592.3978881835938, 809.3495483398438], "pos": [1976.05517578125, 4805.24951171875], "widgets_values": ["selflift/ComfyUI", "auto", "